	- if non-studies tabs exist only in right of studies tabs: [1, 2, 3], 4, 5, 6
	- if non-studies tabs exist only in left of studies tabs: 1, 2, 3, [4, 5, 6]

	For the first case the minimum number of seconds would be:
		min(abs(pos-l), abs(pos-r)) + 1 + abs(l-r) + 1
	In the second case:
		abs(pos-r) + 1
	In the third case:
